        },
        {
          "text": "Wala asiingie mtu nyumbani mwa BWANA, ila makuhani, na hao watumikao wa Walawi; hao wataingia, kwa kuwa hao ni watakatifu; ila watu wote watalinda malinzi ya BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Walawi watamzunguka mfalme pande zote, kila mtu mwenye silaha zake mkononi; naye awaye yote aingiaye nyumbani na auawe; nanyi mfuatane na mfalme, aingiapo na atokapo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.23.7"
            ]
